================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY ACKNOWLEDGMENTS, ATTRIBUTIONS & COPYRIGHT NOTICES
================================================================================

This suite integrates, bridges, and adapts several open-source tools, protocols,
and knowledge engines. We acknowledge and respect the original creators:

1. REMOTION
   - Creator: Jonny Burger & Remotion GmbH
   - Website: https://remotion.dev
   - Purpose: Programmatic video creation in React. Remotion is a registered
     trademark of Remotion GmbH.

2. HYPERFRAMES
   - Purpose: Deterministic HTML/CSS programmatic video rendering suite,
     atomic motion blueprints, and keyframe composition engine.

3. AGENT-BROWSER
   - Purpose: Autonomous web browser automation CLI via Chrome DevTools Protocol (CDP),
     accessibility-tree snapshotting, and web interaction.

4. GRAPHIFY & OBSIDIAN MEMORY SYSTEM
   - Purpose: Persistent codebase and knowledge graph AST parser, community
     detection, and bi-directional continuous sync with Obsidian Vaults.

5. ELEVENLABS API & SDK INTEGRATIONS
   - Creator: ElevenLabs Inc.
   - Purpose: Voice synthesis, voice cloning, audio isolation, and sound design.

6. TAILWIND CSS & SHADCN/UI
   - Creators: Tailwind Labs & shadcn (@shadcn)
   - Purpose: Modern utility-first styling and accessible UI component patterns.

7. DIRECT RESPONSE MARKETING & COPYWRITING INTELLECTUAL ROOTS
   - Frameworks adapted in copywriting skills draw upon foundational direct response
     principles pioneered by Eugene Schwartz, John Caples, Claude Hopkins,
     Gary Halbert, Dan Kennedy, and Donald Miller (StoryBrand).
